title: Start
---
<<declare $dialogPhase = "" >>
<<setPhaseToYarn NPC>>
<<jump load_phase>>
===
title:load_phase
---
<<if $dialogPhase == "start">>
<<jump first_encounter>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_taken">>
<<jump taken_quest>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "">>
ERROR -- I don't know what to do!
<<endif>>
===
title:first_encounter
---
<<cam_move NPC_CAM_Prefab "npc">>
NPC: Hello! Nice to meet you.
NPC: I don't get many strangers around here.
NPC: But you look like a very helpful person.
NPC: Would you be interesting in helping me?
NPC: I can reward you for your time.
NPC: Whatd'ya say?
<<cam_move NPC_CAM_Prefab "pc">>
    ->I can help!
        <<cam_move NPC_CAM_Prefab "npc">>
        Great! Come back when the job is done.
        <<cam_move NPC_CAM_Prefab "return">>
        <<setPhaseFromYarn NPC "quest_taken">>
    ->Not right now.
        <<cam_move NPC_CAM_Prefab "npc">>
        OK, fine, talk later.
        <<cam_move NPC_CAM_Prefab "return">>
===
title:taken_quest
---
<<cam_move NPC_CAM_Prefab "npc">>
NPC: Hey again, good to see you! Doesn't look like you finished what I asked for just yet.
NPC: Come back when you've finsihed what you started.
===